<title>USA: Italy Fund payout from ordinary income up.</title>
<headline>Italy Fund payout from ordinary income up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy Fund Inc on Thursday said it declared a higher annual dividend from ordinary income of $0.155 per share, up from $0.02 for the 1995 year.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend pertains to shareholders of record December 20 1996 and is payable December 24.</p>
<p>The Italy Fund is a closed-end management investment company managed by Smith Barney Mutual Funds Management Inc.</p>
